.SH "نام (NAME)"
exim2dlf \- convert exim logfiles to dlf format
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
\&\fBexim2dlf\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
\&\fBexim2dlf\fR converts a Exim logfile to DLF format.  Information on
the exim Mail Transport Agent can be found on http://www.exim.org/ .
The generic email dlf format is described in email.xml.
.SH "مثال‌ها (EXAMPLES)"
.IX Header "EXAMPLES"
To process a log as produced by Exim
.PP
.Vb 1
\& $ exim2dlf < mail.log
.Ve
.PP
exim2dlf will be rarely used on its own, but is more likely
called by lr_log2report:
.PP
.Vb 1
\& $ lr_log2report exim < /var/log/mail.log
.Ve
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
.IX Header "SEE ALSO"
\&\fBexim\fR\|(1), \fBpostfix2dlf\fR\|(1), \fBsendmail2dlf\fR\|(1), \fBqmail2dlf\fR\|(1)
